      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I understand that most limitations effect performance. I think that polygons limitation, however, has little an effect on Quest and moreever the limitation is the most burden on an user compared to other limitations.\nhttps://twitter.com/yasei_no_otoko/status/1133623233226334209",
