  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At this time avatars with high poly limits in my opinion and experience have not made any significant difference in game play or experience and it would hinder avatar creators and the money they would potentially earn in future endeavor for the quest what u suggest is to up them and see exactly where the breaking point is for both models and worlds to see how much the oculus an take from vrchat and if need be to make a separate server just to handle a little bit of the extra payload. I hope we can solve this issue and make quest vrchat as if not close to amazing as PC",
